# Verification (Biome + typecheck + tests)

Every time you complete a task, make changes, or before finishing your turn, run verification so no lint, type, or test regressions ship.

Project stop hook (`.cursor/hooks.json` → `.cursor/hooks/verify.sh`) runs the same suite after each agent turn and auto-followups on failure.

## Commands

Source NVM when shell may lack Node on PATH:

```bash
. "$HOME/.nvm/nvm.sh" && pnpm verify
```

Or stepwise:

```bash
. "$HOME/.nvm/nvm.sh"
pnpm lint        # biome
pnpm typecheck   # tsc --noEmit
pnpm test:unit   # vitest (no biome re-run)
```

On Windows PowerShell (Node already on PATH):

```powershell
pnpm verify
```

## Actions

- If lint, typecheck, or tests fail — fix immediately.
- Format / auto-fix lint: `pnpm exec biome check --write <file>` or `pnpm exec biome format --write <file>`.
